        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create a customized motivational email for the user.\n\ninput: {{ $json.message.text }}\n\nIf user is not giving any username or email trigger command give the reply gracefully that I don't have enough information to send the mail.\n\nGive the output in JSON format. The template will be \n{ \"To\" : \"\",\n  \"Subject\" : \"\",\n  \"body\" : \"\"}\n\nNo Explanations. No Markdowns.\n\nAlways keep my name \"Pandeeswari Palpandi\" in Best Regards.",
